&lt;p&gt;
	Improvements made:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
		The establishment has been thoroughly cleaned and procedures are in place to ensure that cleanliness is maintained.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
		A new management system has been implemented&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
		The staff have been trained/re-trained/given instruction/are under revised supervision arrangements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	Issues arose because of a change of kitchen management in late Aug (head chef leaving) which as highlighted had left gaps in stock checks and cleaning.&amp;nbsp; We accept that some issues, including equipment repairs and our written food safety system, had been raised before and should have been fixed sooner.&amp;nbsp; That was our failure and they have since been fully addressed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
		Since the inspection we have:&lt;br /&gt;
		Introduced a labelling tool which completes daily use by checks, with original labels never removed or changed.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
		Stored raw and ready to eat foods&amp;nbsp;separately throughout&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
		Repaired all hand wash basins&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
		Completed a professional deep clean, with a daily cleaning schedule&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
		Repaired or replaced the oven, microwave and all fridge and freezer seals&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
		Put a safer food better system in place, with all kitchen staff retrained&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
		We have also applied for a re-rating visit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
